---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy | Word & Character Counter"
	description="Our Privacy Policy outlines how we protect your data. We use client-side processing, meaning your text is never stored or sent to any server."
>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 w-full">
		<header class="mb-16 text-center">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">Last updated: June 9, 2026</p>
		</header>

		<div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Data Privacy Guarantee</h2>
				<p>
					At <strong>Word & Character Counter</strong>, we take your privacy extremely seriously. Unlike many other online tools, we utilize <strong>client-side processing</strong>. This means that all calculations, analysis, and counting happen exclusively within your web browser on your own device.
				</p>
				<p class="bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 p-4 rounded-lg text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-200">
					<strong>Crucial Note:</strong> Your text is never sent to our servers. We do not, and cannot, store or view any content you enter into our tool.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>
					We do not collect any personal information or the text content you analyze. We may collect anonymous, non-identifying usage data (such as page views or button clicks) to help us improve the tool's performance and user experience. This data is purely technical and cannot be linked back to you or your specific content.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. Use of Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					We may use basic cookies or local storage to save your preferences (such as light/dark mode settings). These are stored locally on your device and are not used for tracking or advertising purposes.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
				<p>
					We do not share any data with third parties. Our tool is independent and focused solely on providing you with a safe writing environment.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
				<p>
					If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please feel free to reach out via our contact page.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
